{
  "info": {
    "name": "D-Arrow API",
    "description": "Postman collection for the D-Arrow platform API (Next.js). Primary consumer: mobile app.\n\nBase URL variables:\n  - {{baseUrl}}  = Production https://www.d-arrow.com  (default)\n  - {{localUrl}} = Local dev http://localhost:3000\nSwitch to {{localUrl}} when testing against a local server.\n\nAdmin-only endpoints require a JWT token:\n  1. Call POST /api/admin/auth with the admin password.\n  2. The response contains a `token`.\n  3. Save it in the `adminToken` collection variable (or run the login request and copy it).\n\nAll JSON responses follow: { \"success\": true|false, ...payload } except the email-based endpoints (contact / pricing / chat-log) which return { \"ok\": true }.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": null,
  "event": [],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://www.d-arrow.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "localUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
